* Calculate Runner Status: refreshes event fields and sets RUNNER STATUS.
*   Use this as a race-day monitoring tool.
*   COMPLETE     - FINISH is not empty
*   IN_PROGRESS  - ChipStart is not empty and FINISH is empty
*   STARTING     - no ChipStart or Finish read yet

* Step 1: Clear status and copied event fields
clear-f.rsm         "RUNNER STATUS"
clear-f.rsm         CHIPSTART
clear-f.rsm         FINISH

* Step 2: Refresh event fields
Events2DB.rsm

* Step 3: Classify runners; order matters
set-status-complete.rsm
set-status-inprogress.rsm   CHIPSTART
set-status-starting.rsm
